  "message": "We have a handful of specialist agents. One scans receipts and matches them to expenses. Another looks for expenses that don’t have receipts. We have four “mapper” agents that each focus on a payment type—cash purchases, card purchases, bank transfers and other payments like checks—to spot vendor patterns. A synthesizer pulls those four reports together, flags missed bills, odd amounts and new recurring costs. Finally, a progress checker can tell you which reports already exist and how up‑to‑date they are.",
